cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "YouTube Channel Transcript Fetcher"
abstract: >-
  Bulk-export the transcripts (subtitles / captions) of every video on a
  YouTube channel into one LLM-ready plain-text file. Includes a CLI, a local
  web UI, view-count and age filters, and proxy support. Built on
  youtube-transcript-api.
authors:
